  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reinforced Cooperation and Knowledge for Water Security in Latin America and the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aimed at enhancing water governance and management in LAC, through improved cooperation and institutional and human capacities, with more opportunities for gender equality in decision-making. It will help to maximize the impact of the Conference of Iberoamerican Water Directors (CODIA) and UNESCO work in LAC by combining strengths in complementary areas regarding training courses and knowledge management components building on the establishment of an effective working network.</narrative>
  </description>
